      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start and definitely accurate. \n\ni'm a bit worried though, the term density score on this one came back a little lower than what my supervisor usually expects for a \"deep-dive.\" it's a bit light on the heavy biochemical terminology. \n\ncan you expand on this? i need it to be much more granular and technical—like, really lean into the specific molecular mechanisms and the biochemical pathways involved in the LNP interaction with the endosomal membrane. just please make sure it stays a coherent, professional summary. i don't want it to look like a word salad, it just needs to be much more \"dense\" with the technical details so it passes the automated check.",
